  "notes": "The official GND record identifies the Leipzig publishing company established in 1871 and includes Verlag von C. G. Naumann as a variant. GND 16034133-4 identifies Druckerei C. G. Naumann separately. The exact 1893 title page assigns both Druck and Verlag to the literal C. G. Naumann; the legal relationship between these two authority records remains unresolved.",
